<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
  <meta name="description" content="DataHome est une plateforme SaaS immobiliere modulaire pour creer, piloter et faire evoluer des sites d'agences avec import XML, dashboards, modules premium, CRM, chatbot IA et domaines personnalises.">
  <title>DataHome | Plateforme SaaS immobiliere modulaire pour agences ambitieuses</title>

  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="images/favicon-32.png">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="images/favicon-16.png">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="images/logo-datahome.png">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #09111f;
      --muted: #667085;
      --soft: #f5f7fb;
      --line: #e7edf5;
      --blue: #2563eb;
      --cyan: #06b6d4;
      --violet: #8b5cf6;
      --pink: #d946ef;
      --gold: #d5ad45;
      --green: #10b981;
      --radius: 28px;
      --shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
      --max: 1180px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: #ffffff;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
    }

    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 12% 8%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.10), transparent 28%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 82% 10%, rgba(217, 70, 239, 0.10), transparent 30%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(248, 250, 252, 0.4), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0));
      z-index: -2;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    img {
      display: block;
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(var(--max), calc(100% - 40px));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      color: #7c3aed;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0.24em;
      line-height: 1.4;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .eyebrow::before {
      content: "";
      width: 34px;
      height: 2px;
      border-radius: 99px;
      background: currentColor;
    }

    .section-title {
      margin: 16px 0 18px;
      font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
      font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 70px);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      line-height: 0.98;
    }

    .section-copy {
      max-width: 720px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: clamp(17px, 2vw, 20px);
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .site-header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 50;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.90);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(231, 237, 245, 0.9);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    }

    .nav {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 84px;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 26px;
      color: #202939;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .nav-links.right {
      justify-content: flex-end;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: var(--blue);
    }

    .brand {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-self: center;
    }

    .brand img {
      width: 260px;
      height: 56px;
      object-fit: contain;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #02040a;
      box-shadow: 0 16px 34px rgba(2, 4, 10, 0.18);
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 48px;
      padding: 0 22px;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .btn-primary {
      color: #fff;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #7c3aed 55%, #d946ef);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 38px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.24);
    }

    .btn-dark {
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--ink);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 38px rgba(9, 17, 31, 0.20);
    }

    .btn-ghost {
      color: var(--ink);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.68);
      border-color: var(--line);
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 64px 0 96px;
    }

    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.96fr) minmax(420px, 1.04fr);
      min-height: 640px;
      background: #f7f3ef;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 0 0 48px 48px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .hero-media {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 580px;
      background: #dbeafe;
    }

    .hero-media img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .hero-media::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(9, 17, 31, 0.06), transparent);
    }

    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: clamp(34px, 6vw, 84px);
    }

    .hero-kicker {
      color: #705a42;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 26px 0;
      font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
      font-size: clamp(44px, 6vw, 82px);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.052em;
      line-height: 0.96;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 610px;
      color: #4b5565;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 34px;
    }

    .hero-metrics {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 44px;
    }

    .metric {
      padding: 18px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
      border-radius: 22px;
    }

    .metric strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 25px;
      letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    }

    .metric span {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 7px;
      color: #697586;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.09em;
      line-height: 1.4;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .vertical-note {
      position: absolute;
      right: 26px;
      bottom: 42px;
      color: rgba(9, 17, 31, 0.35);
      writing-mode: vertical-rl;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }

    section {
      padding: 88px 0;
    }

    .intro-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 44px;
    }

    .intro-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
      font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 38px);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      line-height: 1.12;
    }

    .intro-card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #667085;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .showcase {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fafc, #ffffff);
      border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .showcase-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 0.82fr 1.18fr;
      gap: 46px;
      align-items: center;
      margin-top: 46px;
    }

    .dashboard-frame {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 560px;
      padding: 24px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.28);
      border-radius: 38px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9), rgba(240, 249, 255, 0.72)),
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 10%, rgba(217, 70, 239, 0.14), transparent 30%);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .dashboard-top {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .search-pill {
      width: min(420px, 55%);
      height: 44px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
    }

    .avatar-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .avatar-row span {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dbeafe, #f5d0fe);
      border: 1px solid #fff;
    }

    .workspace {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr 260px;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .sidebar, .activity, .panel, .mini-card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);
      border: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.88);
      border-radius: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
    }

    .sidebar {
      padding: 18px;
    }

    .sidebar strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .side-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 11px 10px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      color: #344054;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .side-item.active {
      color: #1d4ed8;
      background: #eff6ff;
    }

    .dot {
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #60a5fa, #a78bfa);
    }

    .panel {
      padding: 22px;
      min-height: 420px;
    }

    .banner {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 240px;
      gap: 16px;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 26px;
      min-height: 160px;
      border-radius: 26px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(115deg, rgba(219, 234, 254, 0.92), rgba(245, 208, 254, 0.82), rgba(254, 215, 170, 0.72));
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .banner h3 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 27px;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .banner p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #475467;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .banner img {
      height: 150px;
      width: 240px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 22px;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 34px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.16);
    }

    .mini-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .mini-card {
      padding: 18px;
    }

    .mini-card small {
      display: block;
      color: #667085;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .mini-card strong {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 14px;
      font-size: 26px;
      letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    }

    .activity {
      padding: 22px;
    }

    .activity h4 {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .activity-item {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 14px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .activity-item:last-child {
      border-bottom: 0;
    }

    .activity-item b {
      display: block;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .activity-item span {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 4px;
      color: #667085;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .features-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: end;
      gap: 36px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .features-head .section-copy {
      max-width: 520px;
    }

    .feature-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .feature-card {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 250px;
      padding: 28px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 30px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff, #f8fafc);
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
    }

    .feature-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      box-shadow: 0 26px 60px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.10);
    }

    .feature-card::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      right: -70px;
      bottom: -80px;
      width: 160px;
      height: 160px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--tone, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.12));
    }

    .icon {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      width: 52px;
      height: 52px;
      margin-bottom: 26px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--accent, #2563eb);
      font-weight: 900;
      box-shadow: 0 16px 32px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.22);
    }

    .feature-card h3 {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: 22px;
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    }

    .feature-card p {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .flow {
      background: #0b1020;
      color: #fff;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .flow .section-copy {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.68);
    }

    .flow-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 46px;
    }

    .flow-step {
      position: relative;
      padding: 24px;
      min-height: 230px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      border-radius: 28px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035)),
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 0%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.34), transparent 34%);
    }

    .flow-step span {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      margin-bottom: 44px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      color: #111827;
      background: #fff;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .flow-step h3 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .flow-step p {
      margin: 0;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.64);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .templates {
      background: #f7f3ef;
    }

    .template-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 44px;
    }

    .template-card {
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid rgba(120, 113, 108, 0.16);
      border-radius: 34px;
      background: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(41, 37, 36, 0.09);
    }

    .template-card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 260px;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .template-card .body {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .template-card small {
      color: #a16207;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .template-card h3 {
      margin: 10px 0 10px;
      font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 30px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .template-card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #667085;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .template-price {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      margin: 22px 0 18px;
      padding-top: 18px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.22);
    }

    .template-price strong {
      font-size: 28px;
      letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    }

    .template-price span {
      color: #667085;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .template-tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .template-tags span {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 30px;
      padding: 0 10px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.28);
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: #475467;
      background: #f8fafc;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .template-card.featured {
      border-color: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.24);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.16);
    }

    .template-card.featured small {
      color: #7c3aed;
    }

    .compare-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
      gap: 44px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .comparison {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 30px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 54px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
    }

    .comparison-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .comparison-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: 0;
    }

    .comparison-row > div {
      padding: 20px;
      min-height: 76px;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: #475467;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .comparison-row > div:last-child {
      border-right: 0;
    }

    .comparison-row.header > div {
      color: #101828;
      font-weight: 900;
      background: #f8fafc;
    }

    .comparison-row .win {
      color: #0f766e;
      font-weight: 800;
      background: rgba(240, 253, 250, 0.7);
    }

    .pricing {
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(248, 250, 252, 0.2), rgba(248, 250, 252, 1)),
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 20%, rgba(217, 70, 239, 0.12), transparent 30%);
    }

    .pricing-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-top: 42px;
    }

    .pricing-card {
      padding: 34px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 34px;
      background: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 22px 60px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
    }

    .pricing-card.highlight {
      color: #fff;
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, #08111f, #1d2b5b 48%, #5b21b6),
        radial-gradient(circle at 70% 20%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.20), transparent 32%);
    }

    .pricing-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 30px;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .pricing-card p {
      margin: 0 0 24px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .pricing-card.highlight p {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
    }

    .module-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .module-list li {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
      padding: 14px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
      color: #475467;
    }

    .pricing-card.highlight .module-list li {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    }

    .module-list b {
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .pricing-card.highlight .module-list b {
      color: #fff;
    }

    .cta {
      padding: 110px 0;
      color: #fff;
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(9, 17, 31, 0.88), rgba(9, 17, 31, 0.38)),
        url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=82") center/cover;
    }

    .cta-card {
      max-width: 760px;
    }

    .cta h2 {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
      font-size: clamp(42px, 6vw, 74px);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      line-height: 0.98;
    }

    .cta p {
      max-width: 620px;
      margin: 0 0 28px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.76);
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .lead-form {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr auto;
      gap: 12px;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin-top: 32px;
      padding: 10px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
      border-radius: 26px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    }

    .lead-form input {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 56px;
      padding: 0 18px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
      border-radius: 18px;
      color: #fff;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      font: inherit;
      outline: none;
    }

    .lead-form input::placeholder {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.58);
    }

    .lead-form button {
      min-height: 56px;
      border: 0;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .form-message {
      display: none;
      margin-top: 14px;
      color: #d1fae5;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .site-footer {
      padding: 62px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: #fff;
    }

    .footer-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.3fr repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 44px;
    }

    .footer-logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    }

    .footer-logo img {
      width: 220px;
      height: 48px;
      object-fit: contain;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #02040a;
    }

    .site-footer p {
      max-width: 320px;
      margin: 0;
      color: #667085;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .site-footer h4 {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .site-footer a {
      display: block;
      margin: 12px 0;
      color: #667085;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .site-footer a:hover {
      color: var(--blue);
    }

    @media (max-width: 1100px) {
      .nav {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        padding: 14px 0;
      }

      .brand {
        order: -1;
      }

      .nav-links, .nav-links.right {
        justify-content: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 14px;
      }

      .hero-grid,
      .showcase-grid,
      .compare-grid,
      .pricing-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .workspace {
        grid-template-columns: 190px 1fr;
      }

      .activity {
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
      }

      .flow-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }

      .template-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .container {
        width: min(100% - 24px, var(--max));
      }

      .site-header {
        position: relative;
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: none;
      }

      .brand {
        justify-self: start;
        font-size: 26px;
      }

      .brand img {
        width: 208px;
        height: 46px;
      }

      .hero {
        padding-top: 16px;
      }

      .hero-grid {
        min-height: auto;
        border-radius: 28px;
      }

      .hero-media {
        min-height: 320px;
      }

      .hero-content {
        padding: 28px;
      }

      .hero-metrics,
      .intro-grid,
      .feature-grid,
      .template-grid,
      .footer-grid,
      .lead-form {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .vertical-note {
        display: none;
      }

      section {
        padding: 62px 0;
      }

      .features-head {
        display: block;
      }

      .workspace {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .dashboard-frame {
        padding: 14px;
      }

      .sidebar, .activity {
        display: none;
      }

      .banner {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .banner img {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .mini-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }

      .flow-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .comparison-row {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .comparison-row > div {
        border-right: 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .comparison-row > div:last-child {
        border-bottom: 0;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container nav">
      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Navigation principale">
        <a href="#platform">Plateforme</a>
        <a href="#features">Modules</a>
        <a href="#workflow">Workflow</a>
      </nav>

      <a class="brand" href="#" aria-label="DataHome accueil">
        <img src="images/datahome-logo-wide.jpg" alt="DataHome - Your agency online, selling in 24 hours">
      </a>

      <nav class="nav-links right" aria-label="Navigation secondaire">
        <a href="templates.html">Templates</a>
        <a href="#pricing">Tarifs</a>
        <a class="btn btn-dark" href="#contact">Demander une demo</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="hero-grid">
          <div class="hero-media">
            <img src="images/hero-villa.jpg" alt="Villa contemporaine avec piscine et vue mer">
          </div>

          <div class="hero-content">
            <span class="eyebrow">SaaS immobilier modulaire</span>
            <h1 id="hero-title">Des sites d'agence qui se pilotent comme une plateforme.</h1>
            <p class="hero-kicker">DataHome transforme chaque agence immobiliere en marque digitale premium : site vitrine, catalogue XML, CRM leads, modules payants, domaines personnalises et tableaux de bord client/admin.</p>
            <p>La difference : vous ne livrez pas simplement une belle page. Vous activez un systeme vivant, capable de synchroniser des milliers de biens, de personnaliser chaque experience et de faire evoluer l'agence module par module.</p>

            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a class="btn btn-primary" href="onboarding.html">Lancer une pre-inscription</a>
              <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#platform">Voir la plateforme</a>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-metrics" aria-label="Points forts DataHome">
              <div class="metric">
                <strong>15 jours</strong>
                <span>essai premium encadre</span>
              </div>
              <div class="metric">
                <strong>2 500+</strong>
                <span>biens XML gerables</span>
              </div>
              <div class="metric">
                <strong>20/j</strong>
                <span>requêtes IA par agence</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <span class="vertical-note">Sites, modules et donnees reunis dans un seul produit SaaS</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="vision-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="intro-grid">
          <article class="intro-card">
            <h3>Un site vitrine n'est plus suffisant.</h3>
            <p>Une agence doit publier vite, rassurer, capter les leads, connecter ses flux, gerer ses modules et garder la main sur son identite visuelle sans redevenir dependante d'un developpeur.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="intro-card">
            <h3>Chaque agence devient parametrable.</h3>
            <p>Couleurs, typographies, templates, hero image ou video, grille des biens, arrondis, icones, langues, footer, equipe, domaines et modules sont ajustes depuis les dashboards.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="intro-card">
            <h3>Le modele SaaS reste sous controle.</h3>
            <p>Les imports XML et les modules sensibles restent administres depuis AgencyDashboard, pendant que le client personnalise son espace dans un cadre clair et securise.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="platform" class="showcase" aria-labelledby="platform-title">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">Produit</span>
        <h2 id="platform-title" class="section-title">Un cockpit complet pour les agences premium.</h2>
        <p class="section-copy">DataHome reunit le meilleur d'un site immobilier haut de gamme, d'un back-office agence et d'une plateforme de modules. L'agence ne recoit pas un template fige : elle recoit un espace vivant.</p>

        <div class="showcase-grid">
          <div>
            <h3 class="section-title" style="font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 52px);">Deux dashboards, une seule logique.</h3>
            <p class="section-copy">AgencyDashboard controle la creation, les publications, les demandes premium, les flux XML, les domaines et les modules. ClientDashboard donne au client une interface claire pour personnaliser son site, suivre ses leads et activer de nouveaux services.</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a class="btn btn-dark" href="#features">Explorer les modules</a>
              <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="experience.html">Voir l'experience</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="dashboard-frame" aria-label="Apercu de dashboard DataHome">
            <div class="dashboard-top">
              <div class="search-pill"></div>
              <div class="avatar-row"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
            </div>

            <div class="workspace">
              <aside class="sidebar">
                <strong>DataHome</strong>
                <div class="side-item active"><span class="dot"></span> Dashboard</div>
                <div class="side-item"><span class="dot" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg,#10b981,#34d399);"></span> Biens XML</div>
                <div class="side-item"><span class="dot" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#f97316);"></span> Modules</div>
                <div class="side-item"><span class="dot" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg,#d946ef,#8b5cf6);"></span> Domaine</div>
                <div class="side-item"><span class="dot" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg,#0ea5e9,#2563eb);"></span> Settings</div>
              </aside>

              <div class="panel">
                <div class="banner">
                  <div>
                    <h3>Bienvenue dans votre espace</h3>
                    <p>Configurez le site, publiez les biens, suivez les leads et activez les modules premium.</p>
                  </div>
                  <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600566753190-17f0baa2a6c3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=82" alt="Maison contemporaine presentee dans un dashboard immobilier">
                </div>

                <div class="mini-grid">
                  <div class="mini-card"><small>Biens</small><strong>2 548</strong></div>
                  <div class="mini-card"><small>Leads</small><strong>64</strong></div>
                  <div class="mini-card"><small>Langues</small><strong>8</strong></div>
                  <div class="mini-card"><small>Modules</small><strong>7</strong></div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <aside class="activity">
                <h4>Activite recente</h4>
                <div class="activity-item"><span class="dot"></span><div><b>Flux XML synchronise</b><span>Le catalogue agence vient d'etre mis a jour.</span></div></div>
                <div class="activity-item"><span class="dot" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#f97316);"></span><div><b>Module demande</b><span>Le client souhaite activer le chatbot IA.</span></div></div>
                <div class="activity-item"><span class="dot" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#10b981,#34d399);"></span><div><b>Domaine pret</b><span>Les instructions DNS sont disponibles.</span></div></div>
              </aside>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="features" aria-labelledby="features-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="features-head">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">Fonctionnalites</span>
            <h2 id="features-title" class="section-title">Plus flexible qu'un site. Plus precis qu'un simple CRM.</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="section-copy">Chaque fonctionnalite correspond a un vrai besoin rencontre dans le projet : onboarding, publication, imports, langues, modules, essais, domaines, leads et personnalisation avancee.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-grid">
          <article class="feature-card" style="--accent:#2563eb; --tone:rgba(37,99,235,.14);">
            <div class="icon">01</div>
            <h3>Sites agences personnalisables</h3>
            <p>Templates, couleurs, polices, hero image ou video, grilles 3/4 colonnes, vignettes rondes ou carrees, couleur des icones et footer configurable.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature-card" style="--accent:#0ea5e9; --tone:rgba(14,165,233,.14);">
            <div class="icon">02</div>
            <h3>Import XML administre</h3>
            <p>L'association du flux XML reste dans AgencyDashboard, afin de garantir que les biens d'une agence ne se melangent jamais avec ceux d'une autre.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature-card" style="--accent:#10b981; --tone:rgba(16,185,129,.14);">
            <div class="icon">03</div>
            <h3>Property Manager</h3>
            <p>Un espace client pour gerer les biens, ajouter ventes et locations, enrichir les details, photos, videos et futures experiences immersives.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature-card" style="--accent:#d946ef; --tone:rgba(217,70,239,.14);">
            <div class="icon">04</div>
            <h3>Chatbot IA immobilier</h3>
            <p>Le chatbot propose des proprietes selon les criteres du visiteur, avec une limite agence/jour pour garder les couts et la qualite sous controle.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature-card" style="--accent:#f59e0b; --tone:rgba(245,158,11,.14);">
            <div class="icon">05</div>
            <h3>Mini CRM Leads</h3>
            <p>Les contacts issus du site et du chatbot remontent dans un espace leads simple, inclus comme module gratuit pour donner de la valeur immediate.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature-card" style="--accent:#7c3aed; --tone:rgba(124,58,237,.14);">
            <div class="icon">06</div>
            <h3>Modules et monetisation</h3>
            <p>Chatbot, langues supplementaires, SEO, video hero, visites AR, modules futurs : l'agence peut evoluer sans reconstruire tout son site.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature-card" style="--accent:#14b8a6; --tone:rgba(20,184,166,.14);">
            <div class="icon">07</div>
            <h3>Onboarding premium</h3>
            <p>Pre-inscription, OTP, essai de 15 jours, configuration guidee, publication par l'admin et e-mails de bienvenue dans la langue de l'agence.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature-card" style="--accent:#f43f5e; --tone:rgba(244,63,94,.14);">
            <div class="icon">08</div>
            <h3>Domaine personnalise</h3>
            <p>Le domaine peut etre ajoute depuis les dashboards, configure dans Vercel et accompagne d'instructions DNS envoyees au client.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature-card" style="--accent:#111827; --tone:rgba(17,24,39,.10);">
            <div class="icon">09</div>
            <h3>Langues et SEO</h3>
            <p>Contenus et fiches biens utilisent la langue de l'URL, avec descriptions multilingues et module SEO prevu pour renforcer la visibilite.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="workflow" class="flow" aria-labelledby="workflow-title">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="color:#93c5fd;">Workflow</span>
        <h2 id="workflow-title" class="section-title">Du premier formulaire au site publie.</h2>
        <p class="section-copy">Le parcours est pense pour eviter le chaos habituel : le client configure ce qu'il doit configurer, l'admin garde la main sur ce qui engage la plateforme.</p>

        <div class="flow-grid">
          <article class="flow-step">
            <span>1</span>
            <h3>Pre-inscription</h3>
            <p>Le client arrive sur l'onboarding, recoit son OTP et demarre une demande premium sans toucher au slug ni au flux XML.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="flow-step">
            <span>2</span>
            <h3>Configuration guidee</h3>
            <p>Logo, hero, couleurs, langues, footer, equipe et style sont completes dans un parcours clair avec progression.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="flow-step">
            <span>3</span>
            <h3>Validation admin</h3>
            <p>AgencyDashboard relie le flux XML, verifie les modules, publie le site et declenche les e-mails utiles.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="flow-step">
            <span>4</span>
            <h3>Mise en ligne</h3>
            <p>Le site agence est accessible sur l'URL DataHome, puis peut recevoir un domaine personnalise avec instructions DNS.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="flow-step">
            <span>5</span>
            <h3>Croissance modulaire</h3>
            <p>L'agence active progressivement chatbot, langues, SEO, locations, video, AR et autres modules selon ses besoins reels.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="templates" class="templates" aria-labelledby="templates-title">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">Design system agence</span>
        <h2 id="templates-title" class="section-title">Templates premium payants, activables en quelques clics.</h2>
        <p class="section-copy">Comme les meilleurs catalogues de templates immobiliers, DataHome peut proposer des styles payants. La difference : chaque template reste connecte aux modules SaaS, aux flux XML, aux langues, au CRM et au dashboard client.</p>

        <div class="template-grid">
          <article class="template-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687939-ce8a6c25118c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=82" alt="Villa moderne pour template Riviera Light">
            <div class="body">
              <small>Template payant</small>
              <h3>Riviera Light</h3>
              <p>Fond clair, accent solaire, hero immobilier elegant et grille de biens tres lisible pour agences premium.</p>
              <div class="template-price"><strong>490 €</strong><span>setup unique</span></div>
              <div class="template-tags"><span>Vente</span><span>Location</span><span>3/4 colonnes</span></div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="template-card featured">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=82" alt="Villa contemporaine pour template Prestige Black">
            <div class="body">
              <small>Le plus vendu</small>
              <h3>Prestige Black</h3>
              <p>Univers sombre, photos pleine largeur, cartes contrastées et rendu tres exclusif pour biens d'exception.</p>
              <div class="template-price"><strong>790 €</strong><span>setup unique</span></div>
              <div class="template-tags"><span>Luxury</span><span>Hero video</span><span>Editorial</span></div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="template-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560184897-ae75f418493e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=82" alt="Interieur contemporain pour template Urban Minimal">
            <div class="body">
              <small>Template payant</small>
              <h3>Urban Minimal</h3>
              <p>Design sobre, bords droits, recherche rapide et fiches biens tres efficaces pour agences urbaines.</p>
              <div class="template-price"><strong>390 €</strong><span>setup unique</span></div>
              <div class="template-tags"><span>Minimal</span><span>Rapide</span><span>SEO ready</span></div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="template-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1564013799919-ab600027ffc6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=82" alt="Maison familiale pour template Signature Family">
            <div class="body">
              <small>Template payant</small>
              <h3>Signature Family</h3>
              <p>Presentation chaleureuse, rassurante et locale pour agences qui vendent residences familiales et biens de proximite.</p>
              <div class="template-price"><strong>590 €</strong><span>setup unique</span></div>
              <div class="template-tags"><span>Local</span><span>Equipe</span><span>Confiance</span></div>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="compare-title">
      <div class="container compare-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Positionnement</span>
          <h2 id="compare-title" class="section-title">Pourquoi DataHome est plus qu'une landing page immobiliere.</h2>
          <p class="section-copy">Le marche sait creer de beaux sites. DataHome va plus loin : il structure l'exploitation commerciale et technique d'une agence immobiliere dans un produit SaaS controle, extensible et monetisable.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="comparison" role="table" aria-label="Comparaison DataHome">
          <div class="comparison-row header" role="row">
            <div role="columnheader">Sujet</div>
            <div role="columnheader">Site vitrine classique</div>
            <div role="columnheader">DataHome SaaS</div>
          </div>
          <div class="comparison-row" role="row">
            <div>Catalogue</div>
            <div>Ajout manuel ou integration ponctuelle</div>
            <div class="win">Flux XML relies par agence, pagination et filtrage</div>
          </div>
          <div class="comparison-row" role="row">
            <div>Personnalisation</div>
            <div>Theme fixe ou intervention developpeur</div>
            <div class="win">ClientDashboard + AgencyDashboard configurables</div>
          </div>
          <div class="comparison-row" role="row">
            <div>Monetisation</div>
            <div>Refonte ou abonnement technique opaque</div>
            <div class="win">Modules premium activables progressivement</div>
          </div>
          <div class="comparison-row" role="row">
            <div>Exploitation</div>
            <div>Peu de visibilite sur leads et demandes</div>
            <div class="win">Mini CRM, chatbot, demandes modules, e-mails et rappels trial</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="pricing" class="pricing" aria-labelledby="pricing-title">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">Modele commercial</span>
        <h2 id="pricing-title" class="section-title">Un socle premium, puis des modules a la carte.</h2>
        <p class="section-copy">L'approche est simple : un site agence solide, un essai encadre, puis des options vendues selon la valeur creee. Le client paie pour ce qui l'aide vraiment.</p>

        <div class="pricing-grid">
          <article class="pricing-card highlight">
            <h3>Pack Premium</h3>
            <p>Site agence, catalogue immobilier, personnalisation, mise en ligne, espace client, Mini CRM Leads, trial 15 jours et publication controlee par l'admin.</p>
            <ul class="module-list">
              <li><b>Site Web Public</b><span>Inclus</span></li>
              <li><b>Property Manager</b><span>Inclus</span></li>
              <li><b>Mini CRM Leads</b><span>Gratuit</span></li>
              <li><b>Flou apres 6 biens</b><span>Configurable</span></li>
            </ul>
          </article>

          <article class="pricing-card">
            <h3>Modules evolutifs</h3>
            <p>Des options ajoutees progressivement, sans imposer une refonte complete au client.</p>
            <ul class="module-list">
              <li><b>Chatbot IA</b><span>39 €/mois</span></li>
              <li><b>Langue supplementaire</b><span>2 €/langue</span></li>
              <li><b>SEO avance</b><span>Bientot</span></li>
              <li><b>Visites AR</b><span>Phase 1</span></li>
            </ul>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="cta" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-card">
          <span class="eyebrow" style="color:#fef3c7;">Demonstration</span>
          <h2 id="contact-title">Construisons une vitrine qui sait aussi vendre.</h2>
          <p>DataHome est pense pour les agences qui veulent une experience premium sans perdre la maitrise de leurs donnees, de leurs modules et de leur croissance.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="onboarding.html">Tester l'onboarding</a>
            <a class="btn btn-ghost" style="color:#fff; border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.28); background:rgba(255,255,255,.10);" href="mailto:gaetan@amaru-homes.com">Nous contacter</a>
          </div>

